# Reference .theme file for plugins_examples/Themes.lua -- see White.theme's
# own header comment for the file format.
#
# Rustic clay/moss/bark tile grid: mid radius, minimal gap -- densely
# packed and grounded, distinct from both Retro's sharp corners and
# Vaporwave's airy spacing. Tile mode (default, home_mode omitted).
